AddSupplyTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given market is frozen
│   └── it should revert
├── given both assets and shares are provided
│   └── it should revert
├── given onBehalf is zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is provided
│   ├── when assets is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when assets is greater than zero
│       ├── when user has sufficient balance
│       │   └── it should add supply and mint shares
│       └── when user has insufficient balance
│           └── it should revert
└── given shares is provided
    ├── when shares is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when shares is greater than zero
        ├── when user has sufficient balance
        │   └── it should add supply and mint shares
        └── when user has insufficient balance
            └── it should revert 